  <running_head>JUSTINIANUS. / LIB. III.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">* <i>Johannes</i> I. cognomento † <i>Africanus</i>, *</l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Petrus</i>, † <i>Silverius</i>, * <i>Vigilius</i>, † <i>Pelagius</i>, <i>Iohannes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">III, cognomento * <i>Catellinus</i>. <i>Bonifacius</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">IIII, <i>Cuius</i> Diofcorus oppofitus erat, coacta <i>Romae</i> ...</l>
    <l n="5">Diofcori affeclas excommunicare voluit, <i>Vigilii</i> ...</l>
    <l n="6">um fibi fuccelforem deftinavit; fed opponentibus</l>
    <l n="7">fe Senatoribus, tententiam fuam revocavit. <i>Idem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">Michaeli Archangelo erectum in <i>Hadriani</i> ...</l>
    <l n="9">templum dedicasse dicitur. Sub <i>Iohanne</i> ...</l>
    <l n="10">quondam a Tyro Hierofolymitanis erepta, ... Iudaeorum</l>
    <l n="11">Hierofolymam translata fuit, &amp; ...</l>
    <l n="12">zarbus, Rex iberorum, Conftantinopoli baptizatus</l>
    <l n="13">... tus eft. <i>Agapetus</i>, Conftantinopolim a Theodorico</l>
    <l n="14">... hato, ut pacem componeret, miflus, Anthimum ...</l>
    <l n="15">Episcopum, haereticos deprehenfum ... ,</l>
    <l n="16">Epifcopatu dejecit, &amp; Mennam ...</l>
    <l n="17">tuit; Augufto vero indignanti, <i>putat</i> ...</l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Christianissimum Principem Iustinianum</i> ...</l>
    <l n="19">nunc autem <i>Diocletianum</i> inveni, relictum ...</l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Silverius</i>, à Theodahato per vim ... ...</l>
    <l n="21">celilario, juffu Augustae, quod Anthimum ...</l>
    <l n="22">uere nollet, exaudoratus * eft, <i>Vigilius</i> ...</l>
    <l n="23">quam Anthimum reftitutionem promifit. ...</l>
    <l n="24">ficatum obtinuit, &amp; cum fide tradita ...</l>
    <l n="25">nem Imperatoris interdixit, &amp; ...</l>
    <l n="26">rum fubitituerctur, metueret, fibi a Belisario ...</l>
    <l n="27">ditum, in Palmeriam infulam deportari jussus.</l>
    <l n="28">Sub eo <i>feftum Hypapantes</i> feu <i>purificationis</i> ... *</l>
    <l n="29">inftitutum, in <i>tertia Aurelianiifi</i> ... neá</l>
    <l n="30">die Coenae Domini, per totum ...</l>
    <l n="31">triduum Christiani fele Iudaeis immilcere, aut ...</l>
    <l n="32">bem quoquo modo circumire liceret, lancinis ...</l>
    <l n="33">in celebratione Paichae apud Orientem ...</l>
